screens=[
('Home page','home','Open /. Use the collection navigation or search to begin browsing. Account, Wishlist and Cart are available in the header.'),
('Login and registration','login','Open /login. Use Sign in for an existing customer account or Create account to register. Staff and administrators use their separate portals.'),
('Browse search and filter','catalog','Open Men, Women or Kids, or choose a collection. Use category tabs, Filter and Sort by. Set a price range or select colours, then open a product.'),
('Select a product variant','product','Choose a colour and size, use Find my size if needed, and select quantity. Add to bag after checking availability. The heart saves the item to Wishlist.'),
('Guest wishlist','wishlist','Save products through heart icons. /wishlist works without login. Guest favourites persist on the same browser; signing in merges them into the account.'),
('Shopping bag','bag-filled','Review selected products, variants and quantities. Remove unwanted items or select items for checkout. Reduce quantity if the stock warning appears.'),
('Checkout','checkout','Enter delivery details or choose a saved address. Apply an eligible promo code. Choose COD or bank transfer and review the total before submitting an order.'),
('Order history','orders','Open Account then Orders. Filter by delivery status and open Order details. A delivered item can expose Request return / refund when eligible.'),
('Profile and delivery addresses','profile','Open Account then Profile. Edit profile information, add or edit delivery addresses and set a default. The address book supports three addresses in total.'),
('Customer offers','offers','Open My Offers to see available assigned promotions. Use the relevant eligible code at checkout. An empty state means no offers are currently assigned.'),
('Staff dashboard','staff-dashboard','Sign in at /staff/login and open /staff. Review operational priorities before opening Orders, Inventory or Returns.'),
('Order operations','staff-orders','Open /staff/orders. Review order details, current payment status and allowed next status. Record payment only when the actual payment has been verified.'),
('Inventory operations','inventory','Open /staff/inventory. Find the relevant product and variant before changing stock. Consult inventory movement history to understand adjustments.'),
('Return handling','staff-returns','Open /staff/returns. Review the decision; receive an authorised return and enter physical inspection notes. Complete a refund or exchange only after a passed inspection.'),
('Administrator dashboard','admin-dashboard','Sign in at /admin/login. Use the dashboard and navigation to review sales, orders, employees, promotions, returns and reports.'),
('Employee management','employees','Open /admin/employees. Create or edit staff records and manage active status. Deactivated accounts must not be used for normal operations.'),
('Promotion management','promotions','Open /admin/promotions. Define eligibility, scope and timing, simulate pricing where available and use the status or approval actions before distributing offers.'),
('Revenue reporting','reports','Open /admin/reports. Select report filters, inspect revenue and business performance and use available export controls. Demo data is not production financial evidence.'),
('Product insights','insights','Open /admin/product-insights. Review customer interest and available SKU metrics. Empty metrics can indicate that the selected period has no tracked activity.'),
('Admin return oversight','admin-returns','Open /admin/returns. Inspect request status, notes and resolution. Automatic authorisation still requires receipt and physical assessment before completion.')]
