d=Doc('03_Installation_Guide_Maison_Rue.pdf')
d.page('Guide for Installation');d.p('Developer setup | Team 1 - T3.2605.E1.FPT');d.pic('home',300);d.section('Required software','Node.js 22.12 or later, npm, a Microsoft SQL Server instance, a SQL management client and a modern browser. Vite also supports Node 20.19 or later in its supported 20.x range.');d.section('Project files','Use the supplied Maison Rue repository. package.json contains startup and database scripts; server/db contains the schema, seed and migrations.');d.section('Before installation','Use a separate development database. Migration and seed commands change database records; back up an existing database before applying them.')
d.page('1  Configure the environment');d.section('Install dependencies','Open a terminal in the repository root and run <font face="Courier">npm install</font>. Keep the package lockfile with the project.');d.section('Local configuration','Copy .env.example to .env, then set your own database connection and session secret. Do not publish real credentials.');d.table([['Setting','Development configuration'],['PORT','5001, or another available API port'],['CLIENT_ORIGIN','http://localhost:5173'],['DB_SERVER and DB_PORT','Your SQL Server host and TCP port, typically 1433'],['DB_NAME','MaisonRueDB'],['DB_USER and DB_PASSWORD','A valid SQL login for this development database'],['JWT_SECRET','A unique randomly generated secret'],['DB_TRUST_SERVER_CERTIFICATE','true for a trusted local development server']],[160,351]);d.p('The example file defaults PORT to 5000. The current local project uses 5001. Vite reads PORT to proxy /api, so keep the running API and environment aligned.',small)
d.page('2  Prepare SQL Server');d.section('Create and connect','Create an empty database named MaisonRueDB in your SQL management client. Enable TCP connectivity and verify the host, port and SQL login from the development machine.');d.section('Apply schema and seed','Run <font face="Courier">npm run db:migrate</font>. The script executes server/db/schema.sql, incremental SQL files and the seed. Read all warnings: an already existing object and a failed migration are not equivalent.');d.section('Optional demonstration setup','npm run setup additionally runs metrics, cost, analytics and promotion distribution scripts. It changes demonstration data and is intended for a development environment.');d.flow(['SQL Server reachable and MaisonRueDB exists','Environment points to the intended database','npm run db:migrate','Inspect migration output and seeded records','Start API and frontend']);d.p('Do not rerun catalogue replacement scripts as a routine troubleshooting step.',small)
d.page('3  Start the project');d.section('Combined startup','Run <font face="Courier">npm run dev</font>. scripts/dev.js starts Express and Vite together. Keep this process running while using the website.');d.section('Separate terminals','Alternatively run <font face="Courier">npm run server</font> and <font face="Courier">npm run client</font> in separate terminals.');d.table([['Check','Expected result'],['http://localhost:5173','Storefront loads'],['http://localhost:5001/api/health','Successful API health response when PORT is 5001'],['http://localhost:5001/api/products','Product response from the API'],['Backend terminal','SQL Server connected and API listening'],['npm run build','Vite production build completes']],[245,266]);d.section('Port conflicts','If Vite selects 5174, check the existing 5173 process and permitted client origin. If the backend reports its port is occupied, identify the old process before stopping or replacing it.');d.pic('catalog',220)
d.page('4  Demo portal access');d.p('These are development seed defaults. Existing accounts may retain a different password; the seed does not reset every existing password.');d.table([['Portal','Seed email','Initial password'],['Customer','vudat9532@gmail.com','customer123'],['Staff','staffmaisonrue@gmail.com','staff123'],['Admin','vanhung29993@gmail.com','admin123']],[80,291,140]);d.section('Portal paths','Customer /login<br/>Staff /staff/login<br/>Administrator /admin/login');d.pic('admin-login',275);d.p('Replace demonstration accounts before public deployment. Never use sample bank details as a real payment instruction.',small)
d.page('5  Optional external services');d.section('Google address suggestions','Set GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY for the server integration. Enable the required Places and Geocoding services for the implementation, configure billing if required by the provider, and restrict access appropriately. Restart the backend after changes.');d.section('Rue assistant','The current UI reads VITE_CHAT_API_KEY and calls an external chat service. VITE values are included in the browser bundle; move secret bearing AI calls to the backend before a public deployment. Without configuration, the assistant uses a fallback response.');d.section('Email workflows','Configure the EmailJS service, public key and templates used by the code. Verify delivery with test recipients before relying on order, return or stock emails.');d.section('Newsletter','The footer currently has a subscription interface. A visible success state must not be treated as proof of integration with a mailing list provider.');d.section('Verification','Test address suggestions, assistant responses and email delivery separately. Core product browsing should not be used as evidence that an external integration is operational.')
d.page('6  Troubleshooting and handover');d.table([['Symptom','Checks'],['Cannot connect to server','Confirm API process, PORT, Vite proxy and SQL Server availability.'],['HTTP 500','Inspect the failing request and server log; check migration failures and database connection.'],['Empty exchange options','Verify order item product ID, active variants and the exchange options API response.'],['No delivered orders','Confirm account identity, database and order filter; use a dedicated delivered demo order.'],['Address dropdown unavailable','Verify API key, enabled services, restrictions and backend response.'],['Build or JSX error','Read Vite file and line output; repair syntax before restarting.']],[155,356]);d.section('Release checks','Build frontend assets; configure a production server or reverse proxy, TLS, secure cookies, database backups and service secrets. Vite development mode is not a production deployment.');d.section('Useful commands','npm run build<br/>npm run lint<br/>npm test<br/>These commands are provided by the repository; execute them in the intended test environment.');d.done()

